My response is in regards to using an ln17ps printer and not an lps17
printserver printer.

> Is it possible to have a single queue for this printer that will
> accept both postscript and ascii?

Yes. Your choices are:

        - Use lprsetup and select printer type ps_level1
        - Use lprsetup and select printer type ln17ps

If you are printing files containing PCL printer escape sequences:

          cp /usr/lbin/pcf/ln17ps.pcf /usr/lbin/pcf/my_ln17ps.pcf
          edit /usr/lbin/pcf/my_ln17ps.pcf

          Add "auto passthru:Y" after "filter type:PCL" to yeild the
results:

                filter type:PCL
                auto passthru:Y

        Use lprsetup and select printer type ln17ps.
        Edit the printcap entry and change 'if' and 'of' to use
        my_ln17ps.pcf instead of ln17ps.pcf.


