         date testing.

       2.Shut down and reboot the system.

       3.After all the tests have been performed and the system
         shutdown and reboot are completed, reset the system date to
         the current date and time by using the date command, NTP, or
         any other method you prefer.

       4.Restore the disk backups so that normal production operation
         can resume.
