> This host is also the DNS server. I have not included the "aaa.bbb.eee.ggg"
> information into the DNS database. May this be a problem??
> 
> Any idea please ??
> Thanks.

I think you should put it in the same ifconfig line (=ifconf_0="a.b.c.d
netmask-x.x.x.x alias a.b.c.e") And for 255.255.255.0 i don't think you
have to specify the netmask anyway..
What you're actually doing here is assigning another address to the same
interace, not the second one..IFCONFIG_0 is meant for if0, IFCONFIG_1
for if1...

Jure
